;; Added by aiswmm when landing the SWMMCanada bundle: the upstream
;; INP omits [REPORT], and without NODES/LINKS lines swmm5 stores NO
;; per-element time series in the binary .out, which makes hydrograph
;; plotting impossible downstream (found live 2026-08-09). The
;; pristine upstream INP remains inside 10_upstream/swmmcanada/.
